          "book": "JDG",
          "chapter": 3,
          "verse": 1
        }
      ],
      "en": "Now these are the nations which the LORD left, to test Israel by them, even as many as had not known all the wars of Canaan;",
      "ko": "여호와께서 가나안 전쟁을 알지 못한 이스라엘을 시험하려 하시며",
      "source_text_hash": "b5a2d30aae29cfc3b173cdb6f859681def4f03e0d942dfcf92fb5ddab1005b3c",
      "translation_text_hash": "a7f198f7b0d52d7ecec0ccca4fa71a0652a4735df1c50f8669ff518f2b6dbf15",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호와께서 가나안 전쟁을 알지 못한 이스라엘을 시험하려 하시며"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "a7f198f7b0d52d7ecec0ccca4fa71a0652a4735df1c50f8669ff518f2b6dbf15"
      ]
    },
    {
