      "en": "The children of Israel served Eglon the king of Moab eighteen years.",
      "ko": "이에 이스라엘 자손이 모압 왕 에글론을 십 팔년을 섬기니라",
      "source_text_hash": "b49a4a406947e69b2a6a99966f1d394bbd269c8f8bcbb7b23aaba55819f8625f",
      "translation_text_hash": "4168e3426591369d39b5c9796d2266b21da7cd5cca3bca386ec222cd2ca9ee26",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
