      "en": "Ehud put out his left hand, and took the sword from his right thigh, and thrust it into his body.",
      "ko": "에훗이 왼손으로 우편 다리에서 칼을 빼어 왕의 몸을 찌르매",
      "source_text_hash": "afa64fcb1cbd0b14008a3857a19cfee0b709f154ef28b230143585ac93412f97",
      "translation_text_hash": "94877087cfb5bae2e5f242ab9b96022e749c7d857a65e740842b209daa91d059",
