      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JDG",
          "chapter": 3,
          "verse": 27
        }
      ],
      "en": "When he had come, he blew a trumpet in the hill country of Ephraim; and the children of Israel went down with him from the hill country, and he led them.",
      "ko": "그가 이르러서는 에브라임 산지에서 나팔을 불매 이스라엘 자손이 산지에서 그를 따라 내려오니 에훗이 앞서 가며",
      "source_text_hash": "007f801aebd42fc7fb97860e33475ae67240741a9c16f956ac4e3466dd5e37df",
      "translation_text_hash": "f4f09b4ded98a4979c537ef9e9aeb4a8d5af05e9d5e87f81765b4a9921291028",
